0..72 Comment "// A shift renaming adds its amount to an index, and two shifts compose."
73..149 Comment "// `rlook` takes its index apart, so at an index that does not compute — a"
150..227 Comment "// sum, another lookup — a shift\'s lookup is stuck; these paths say what it"
228..257 Comment "// is, by cases on the index."
259..304 Comment "// The naturals; the syntax; the congruences."
